# NASA93 Software Effort Estimation

This project uses the NASA93 dataset to train ML models (Random Forest, kNN, etc.) to predict software effort (person-months).

## Files
- `projml.ipynb`: Jupyter notebook with preprocessing, modeling, evaluation.
- `csv_result-nasa93.csv`: Dataset used.
- `requirements.txt`: Python dependencies.

## How to run
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
jupyter notebook
